# Hook telemetry sinks (moved from ~/.claude 2026-08-12). High-churn append-only
# logs written by ~/.claude/hooks/lib.sh on every hook fire -- data, not source.
.sounding/

# Transferable state -- carries the system, not the person. Re-allowed explicitly.
!.sounding/queue.md              # cross-repo pointer; must survive clone for mobile /meta-wake
!.sounding/refs/                 # mobile mirror of ~/.claude/refs (stack conventions)
!.sounding/refs/**
# dashboard moved to docs/dashboard.html (GUA-164); no longer in .sounding/
